      <activity id="083aa3ba-603f-5ba8-a349-ad5fb3e7e494" activityNameId="64a479e9-24f1-5016-b99c-be9cd8c2ed3d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Asphalt plant operation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Asphalt plant operation
The data on the technical infrastructure originates from Ammann Schweiz AG, one of the world’s leading manufacturers of mixing plants and machinery for the construction industry, with core expertise in road construction and transport infrastructure. 
UUID: 78f8fd8d-3b59-4189-bd30-430525726fb8
The process includes the plant buildings, process technology, silos, tanks, exhaust ducts, and conveyor belts.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: According to Ammann Schweiz AG, an average asphalt mixing plant has a service life of around 25 years, with an operating time of 750 h/a and an annual production of approximately 80'000 tons.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 80'000 tons
Sampling: Survey
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_78f8fd8d-3b59-4189-bd30-430525726fb8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
